<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine says set $5.12 bln reverse repos Aug 13.</title>
<headline>Argentine says set $5.12 bln reverse repos Aug 13.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Thursday it placed $5.12 billion in overnight reverse repurchase agreements August 13.</p>
<p>The reverse repos were placed at 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
